<title>MEXICO: Mexico's Dec '96 coffee exports down from Dec '95.</title>
<headline>Mexico's Dec '96 coffee exports down from Dec '95.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican coffee exports shrunk in December 1996 to 390,137 60-kg bags, compared to 421,445 bags exported in the same month the previous year, the Mexican Coffee Council said in a report obtained Tuesday.</p>
<p>Year-to-date exports are still above levels obtained in the 1995-1996 cycle, the council said, giving no reasons for the decline in coffee placed on international markets in December.</p>
</text>
